**component_interface.hpp defines the polymorphic asset-component lifecycle interface.**

## Interface

`component_interface`: virtual `~component_interface()`, `post_start()`, `post_load()`, `pre_destroy()`, `load_import(const std::string&, const std::string&) -> void*`, `is_supported() -> bool`, `get_type() -> game::XAssetType`.

## Defaults

`load_import` returns `nullptr`; `is_supported` returns `true`; `get_type` returns `game::ASSET_TYPE_INVALID`; lifecycle hooks are no-ops.